aints: C at 4 (yes). A before C (pos3 < pos4) and not at 1 (yes). B immediate after D (pos2 = pos1+1). Works.\n\nThus sequence: D, B, A, C.\n\nBut is there any other possible arrangement? Let's test D at position 3, B at 4, but C is at 4, conflict. D at position >3? Not possible because C at 4, so D cannot be after C if B after D must be after D. D at 4 can't, B at 5 would be beyond array of length 4. But maybe array length >4. Could be longer. But likely minimal length is 4.\n\nThus answer: [D,B,A,C] or \"D B A C\".\n\nBut user wrote \"输出演讲顺序数组\". That could mean \"output the sequence array\". So answer likely: [\"D\",\"B\",\"A\",\"C\"].\n\nBut could also be \"D B A C\". Provide explanation.\n\nThus answer: 数组 = ['D','B','A','C'].\n\nBut maybe they want to output as \"D B A C\". Let's provide that.\n\nAlso maybe they want to show that the only solution is D B A C.\n\nWe need to answer in Chinese, as the question is Chinese. Provide explanation and answer.\n\nThus final answer: 输出数组为 {D, B, A, C}.\n\nAlternatively, if they want to display array as [D, B, A, C].\n\nThus answer: [D, B, A, C].\n\nWill include reasoning.\n\nThus final.",
